        <p>『おゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42318-42336"><rb>左樣</rb><rt>さう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42336-42351">でせうとも</seg><choice source="#source-42351-42357"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice>。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42366-42387"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42387-42390">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42390-42405"><rb>餘</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42405-42411">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42411-42432"><rb>可愛</rb><rt>かあい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42432-42438">さに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42438-42462"><rb>少年</rb><rt>せうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42462-42465">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42465-42489"><rb>頭上</rb><rt>づじやう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42489-42504"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42504-42507">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42507-42519"><rb>差</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42519-42522">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42522-42534"><rb>上</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42534-42543">げて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42543-42594"><rb>大日本帝國</rb><rt>だいにつぽんていこく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42594-42618"><rb>萬歳</rb><rt>ばんざい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42618-42621">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42621-42667"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-8-11" source="#source-42621-42655">呌</g></rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42667-42676">ぶと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42676-42700"><rb>少年</rb><rt>せうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42700-42703">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-42703-42724"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-42724-42727">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" s