        <p><seg source="#source-227030-227033">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227033-227054"><rb>何會社</rb><rt>どこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227054-227057">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227057-227127"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-79-6" source="#source-227057-227112">滊</g><seg source="#source-227112-227115">船</seg></rb><rt>ふね</rt></ruby>だらう。』</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-227144-227147">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227147-227174"><rb>商船</rb><rt>しようせん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227174-227189">だらうか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227189-227222"><rb>郵便船</rb><rt>ゆうびんせん</rt></ruby>だらうか。』</p>
        <p>『いや、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227254-227278"><rb>軍艦</rb><rt>ぐんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227278-227281">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227281-227302"><rb>相違</rb><rt>さうゐ</rt></ruby>ない。』</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-227316-227319">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227319-227343"><rb>軍艦</rb><rt>ぐんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227343-227370">にしても、あんなに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227370-227385"><rb>速</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227385-227388">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227388-227412"><rb>船脚</rb><rt>ふなあし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227412-227415">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227415-227439"><rb>新式</rb><rt>しんしき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227439-227475"><rb>巡洋艦</rb><rt>じゆんやうかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227475-227481">か、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227481-227529"><rb>水雷驅逐艦</rb><rt>すいらいくちくかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227529-227532">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227532-227547"><rb>他</rb><rt>ほか</rt></ruby>はあるまい。』と二<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227574-227592"><rb>等</rb><rt>とう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227592-227625"><rb>運轉手</rb><rt>うんてんしゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227625-227628">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227628-227649"><rb>非番</rb><rt>ひばん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227649-227670"><rb>舵手</rb><rt>だしゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227670-227673">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227673-227694"><rb>水夫</rb><rt>すゐふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227694-227697">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227697-227718"><rb>火夫</rb><rt>くわふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227718-227721">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227721-227742"><rb>船丁</rb><rt>ボーイ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227742-227745">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-227745-227760"><rb>至</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-227760-227772">るまで、</seg