        <p><seg source="#source-265284-265287">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265287-265311"><rb>夫人</rb><rt>おくさん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265311-265314">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265314-265332"><rb>其樣</rb><rt>そん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265332-265335">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265335-265362"><rb>事處</rb><rt>ことどころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265362-265383">でありません、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265383-265404"><rb>貴女</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265404-265407">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265407-265431"><rb>少年</rb><rt>せうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265431-265437">とは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265437-265455"><rb>如何</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265455-265464">しても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265464-265482"><rb>助</rb><rt>たすか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265482-265509">らねばなりません、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265509-265530"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265530-265533">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265533-265545"><rb>濟</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265545-265554">まない</seg><choice source="#source-265554-265560"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice>。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265569-265584"><rb>叫</rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265584-265590">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265590-265611"><rb>見渡</rb><rt>みわた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265611-265617">すと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265617-265641"><rb>此時</rb><rt>このとき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265641-265662"><rb>第二</rb><rt>だいに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265662-265665">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265665-265689"><rb>端艇</rb><rt>たんてい<