        <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)"><seg source="#source-352999-353026">第十二回　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-353026-353050"><rb>海軍</rb><rt>かいぐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-353050-353053">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-353053-353068"><rb>家</rb><rt>いへ</rt></ruby></p>
