        <p><seg source="#source-476579-476582">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476582-476603"><rb>他日</rb><rt>たじつ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476603-476615"><rb>我</rb><rt>わ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476615-476618">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476618-476669"><rb>海底戰鬪艇</rb><rt>かいていせんとうてい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476669-476675">が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476675-476723"><rb>帝國軍艦旗</rb><rt>ていこくぐんかんき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476723-476726">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476726-476747"><rb>飜</rb><rt>ひるがへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476747-476756">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476756-476831"><rb><seg source="#source-476756-476762">千艇</seg><g ref="#gaiji-197-12" source="#source-476762-476798">且</g><seg source="#source-476798-476801">艦</seg></rb><rt>せんていばんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476831-476834">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476834-476852"><rb>間</rb><rt>あひだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476852-476855">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476855-476867"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476867-476873">つの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476873-476888"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476888-476891">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476891-476909"><rb>願</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-476909-476972"><lem>ねがは</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-476957-476966">ねがほ</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-476972-476978">くば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476978-476993"><rb>其</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-476993-477005"><rb>名</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477005-477008">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-4770