        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477160-477175"><rb>此</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477175-477196"><rb>談話</rb><rt>だんわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477196-477199">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477199-477214"><rb>叔</rb><rt>をは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477214-477223">ると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477223-477244"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477244-477247">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477247-477268"><rb>大佐</rb><rt>たいさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477268-477271">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477271-477289"><rb>別</rb><rt>わかれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477289-477292">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477292-477304"><rb>告</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477304-477310">げ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477310-477352"><rb>武村兵曹</rb><rt>たけむらへいそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477352-477355">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477355-477370"><rb>送</rb><rt>おく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477370-477382">られて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477382-477397"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477397-477400">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477400-477424"><rb>不思議</rb><rt>ふしぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477424-477430">なる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477430-477445"><rb>道</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477445-477448">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477448-477534"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-198-4" source="#source-477448-477525"/></rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477534-477543">ぎて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477543-477591"><rb>秘密造船所</rb><rt>ひみつぞうせんじよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-477591-477594">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" re