        <p>『これです、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510623-510680"><rb>自動冐險鐵車</rb><rt>じどうぼうけんてつしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510680-510683">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510683-510707"><rb>設計</rb><rt>せつけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510707-510728">といふのは――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510728-510740"><rb>先</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510740-510743">づ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510743-510758"><rb>此</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510758-510782"><rb>鐵檻</rb><rt>てつおり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510782-510785">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510785-510803"><rb>車</rb><rt>くるま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510803-510806">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510806-510830"><rb>恰形</rb><rt>かくこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510830-510833">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510833-510857"><rb>木牛</rb><rt>もくぎう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510857-510860">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510860-510872"><rb>似</rb><rt>に</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510872-510878">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510878-510893"><rb>長</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510893-510905">さ二十二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510905-510926"><rb>尺</rb><rt>しやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510926-510929">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510929-510947"><rb>幅員</rb><rt>はゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510947-510953">十三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510953-510974"><rb>尺</rb><rt>じやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510974-510977">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510977-510992"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-510992-510998">さは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-510998-511031"><r