        <p><seg source="#source-574329-574332">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574332-574347"><rb>何</rb><rt>なに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574347-574350">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574350-574368"><rb>左樣</rb><rt>さう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574368-574380">でない、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574380-574395"><rb>此</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574395-574410"><rb>獸</rb><rt>じう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574410-574413">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574413-574431"><rb>泥土</rb><rt>どろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574431-574437">と、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574437-574461"><rb>松脂</rb><rt>まつやに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574461-574470">とで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574470-574491"><rb>毛皮</rb><rt>けがわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574491-574494">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574494-574509"><rb>鐵</rb><rt>てつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574509-574521">のやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574521-574536"><rb>固</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574536-574542">めて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574542-574554"><rb>居</rb><rt>を</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574554-574572">るのだから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574572-574596"><rb>小銃</rb><rt>せうじう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574596-574599">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574599-574617"><rb>彈丸</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574617-574635"><rb>位</rb><rt>ぐらい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574635-574641">では</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574641-574662"><rb>容易</rb><rt>ようゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-574662-574665">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-574665-574683"><rb>貫</rb><rt>つらぬ</