        <p>『あゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616252-616273"><rb>大佐</rb><rt>たいさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616273-616276">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616276-616294"><rb>叔父</rb><rt>おぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616294-616306">さんは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616306-616336"><rb>私共</rb><rt>わたくしども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616336-616339">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616339-616366"><rb>今日歸</rb><rt>けふかへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616366-616375">るか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616375-616393"><rb>明日</rb><rt>あす</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616393-616408"><rb>歸</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616408-616417">るかと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616417-616429"><rb>待</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616429-616453">つていらつしやる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616453-616471"><rb>處</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616471-616477">へ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616477-616495"><rb>此樣</rb><rt>こん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616495-616498">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616498-616519"><rb>手紙</rb><rt>てがみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616519-616522">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616522-616534"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616534-616561">つたら、どんなにか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616561-616585"><rb>喫驚</rb><rt>びつくり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616585-616594">なさる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616594-616609"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby>でせう。』と、いふと<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616639-616681"><rb>武村兵曹</rb><rt>たけむらへいそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-616681-616684">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-616684-616705"><rb>小首</rb><rt>こくび</rt></