        <p><seg source="#source-617108-617111">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-617111-617129"><rb>其樣</rb><rt>そん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-617129-617132">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-617132-617147"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-617147-617162">があつては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-617162-617174"><rb>濟</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby>まぬね。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-617192-617213"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-617213-617216">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-617216-617231"><rb>直</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-617231-617237">ちに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-617237-617252"><rb>文</rb><rt>ふみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-617252-617255">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-617255-617270"><rb>續</rb><rt>つゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-617270-617281">けた。</seg></p>
