        <p>『あゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622575-622590"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622590-622611"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622611-622614">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622614-622629"><rb>惡</rb><rt>わる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622629-622641">いのだ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622641-622662"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたくし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622662-622665">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622665-622686"><rb>失策</rb><rt>しくじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622686-622707">つたばかりに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622707-622728"><rb>一同</rb><rt>みんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622728-622731">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622731-622749"><rb>此樣</rb><rt>こん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622749-622752">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622752-622773"><rb>憂目</rb><rt>うきめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622773-622776">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622776-622788"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622788-622794">せる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622794-622809"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby>か。』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622821-622836"><rb>深</rb><rt>ふか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622836-622839">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622839-622863"><rb>嘆息</rb><rt>たんそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622863-622875">したが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622875-622893"><rb>忽</rb><rt>たちま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622893-622896">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622896-622914"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622914-622917">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-622917-622941"><rb>取直</rb><rt>とりなほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-622