        <p>『あゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-630809-630833"><rb>今迄</rb><rt>いまゝで</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-630833-630848"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-630848-630851">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-630851-630878"><rb>音沙汰</rb><rt>おとさた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-630878-630881">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-630881-630893"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-630893-630905">いのは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-630905-630929"><rb>稻妻</rb><rt>いなづま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-630929-630932">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-630932-630953"><rb>途中</rb><rt>とちう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-630953-630956">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-630956-630968"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby>んでしまつたのでせう。』と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631010-631052"><rb>日出雄少年</rb><rt>ひでをせうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631052-631055">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631055-631079"><rb>悄然</rb><rt>せうぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631079-631091">として、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631091-631133"><rb>武村兵曹</rb><rt>たけむらへいそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631133-631136">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631136-631151"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631151-631154">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631154-631169"><rb>眺</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631169-631180">めた。</seg></p>
        <p>『イヤ、イヤ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631201-631225"><rb>稻妻</rb><rt>いなづま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631225-631228">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631228-631273"><rb>尋常一樣</rb><rt>じんじやういちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631273-631276">の</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-631291-631357"><lem><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631276-631291"><rb>犬</rb><rt>いぬ</rt></ruby></lem><rdg type="base-text"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631336-631351"><rb>大</rb><rt>いぬ</rt></ruby></rdg></app><seg source="#source-631357-631375">でないから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631375-631396"><rb>屹度</rb><rt>きつと</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631396-631414"><rb>無事</rb><rt>ぶじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631414-631417">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631417-631441"><rb>海岸</rb><rt>かいがん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631441-631447">へは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631447-631462"><rb>達</rb><rt>たつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631462-631480">したらうが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631480-631495"><rb>然</rb><rt>しか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631495-631501">し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631501-631522"><rb>吾等</rb><rt>われら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631522-631525">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631525-631549"><rb>災難</rb><rt>さいなん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631549-631552">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631552-631576"><rb>非常</rb><rt>ひじやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631576-631579">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631579-631594"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631594-631606">だから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-631606-631642"><rb>大佐閣下</rb><rt>たいさかくか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-631642-631648">でも