      <div type="layout" source="#source-781822-782194" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p><seg source="#source-781857-781881">鼻髯を捻つた――</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-781890-781944"><lem><seg source="#source-781881-781890">夢では</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-781929-781938">夢でば</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-781944-781986">ありますまいか――私は何より</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-12-73" source="#source-781986-782048">憘</g><seg source="#source-782048-782158">しい――大分色は黒くなりましたよ、はい――今度は貴女の順番――四年前の話</seg></p>
