        <p>『おゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784294-784351"><rb>松島海軍大佐</rb><rt>まつしまかいぐんたいさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784351-784357">よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784357-784408"><rb>濱島武文君</rb><rt>はまじまたけぶみくん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784408-784414">よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784414-784450"><rb>春枝夫人</rb><rt>はるえふじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784450-784456">よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784456-784486"><rb>貴方等</rb><rt>あなたがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784486-784489">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784489-784513"><rb>喜悦</rb><rt>よろこび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784513-784525">にまで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784525-784549"><rb>少年</rb><rt>せうねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784549-784552">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784552-784570"><rb>無事</rb><rt>ぶじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784570-784579">です、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-784579-784597"><rb>無事</rb><rt>ぶじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-784597-784603">です</seg><g ref="#gaiji-329-6" source="#source-784603-784638"/>。』</p>
